# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data and outputs
#
# No GLA telemetry, derived dataset, or trained model belongs in this
# repository. The patterns below are deliberately broad: the raw telemetry is
# restricted and the intermediate datasets are several gigabytes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
NLB/
TH/
Merged datasets/
Merged_datasets/
results-temp/
results-temp2/
CERES_results/
drifted/
input-utc/
input-utc-cl/
Telemetry Data-UTC/
Climate Data/
x-y test sets/
moving_averages/

# Data and model artefacts, wherever they appear
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.nc
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.h5
*.parquet
weather_data.csv
solar_insolation_data.csv

# Evolutionary-run logs (NLB_*.txt / TH_*.txt) and exported trees.
# best_features.txt is committed deliberately -- see the negation below.
*_firstValues.txt
*_nofirstValues.txt
*_all_combinations.txt
NLB_[0-9]*.txt
TH_[0-9]*.txt
!best_features.txt

